      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SILENT MINUTE (1) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 4.5 lengths into second (23.14) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 401m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Key chance in this line up. SPRING CRUISER (3) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (23.42) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Has the ability to give this a shake. SPRING ROTA (6) recorded a Grade 4/5 win two back then missed the frame last time at Wentworth Park, but drawn Box 6 this time where he has won before. Has the ability and can find best this time. SPRING DAZZLER (8) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
